", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 75, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.26", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["专业高清写真级画质，8K分辨率，皮肤质感细腻，背景衬托人物肤色白皙，侧逆光突出人物发丝的光泽感。场景设定在公园的枫树下（枫树叶是红色的，飘落几片），一位20多岁的中国美女自拍。她穿着红色针织毛衣，毛衣质地厚实，搭配黑色紧身裤，脚踩黑色短靴，头发扎成马尾辫，发尾微微卷曲，戴着红色针织帽。配饰是银色耳钉，形状是枫叶，脖子上戴着一条红色围巾，围巾质地是羊毛的，十分保暖。手持红色智能手机，手机壳是硅胶材质，颜色是红色，印着枫叶图案，手机挂着红色毛绒挂饰。自拍角度为轻微仰拍，她站在枫树下，右手举着手机，左手轻轻接住一片飘落的枫叶，身体微微侧对镜头，头微偏，嘴角带着甜美的笑容，眼睛看向镜头，整体画面温暖甜美，尽显可人气质。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "string"}, "name": "string", "label": "string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}], "flags": {"pinned": false}, "type": "String Literal", "title": "提示词 一行一个", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [556.875, 599.4375], "pos": [-3054.4267578125, -477.5563049316406], "id": 55, "properties": {"cnr_id": "image-saver", "ver": "65e6903eff274a50f8b5cd768f0f96baf37baea1", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "String Literal"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [], "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-1449.400390625, 609.816650390625], "widgets_values": ["刘亦菲"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 87, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 10}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "workspace_info": {"id": "gPgYFtOjyuG1ZhLSumoJY"}, "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "workflowRendererVersion": "LG", "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.32.9", "VHS_latentpreview": 